id: pmc-zoqj
title: Measure changelog parser CPU time without counting descheduled workers
description: "The full release gate on a busy shared host fails replace-release and bracketed-heading 250ms wall timers despite safe linear implementations. Preserve a strict 250ms operation CPU budget and bounded parent watchdog, measure inside the already-loaded child, and prove the historical pathological regex remains rejected. This keeps the adversarial parser gate meaningful under concurrent fleet validation."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: performance,regression,tests
created_at: "2026-09-07T23:13:50.939Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-07T23:41:19.997Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-07T23:41:07.373Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-07T23:41:07.373Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: All existing public parser operations retain hostile inputs and assertions; child CPU cost remains at most 250ms; hung workers remain killable; historical vulnerable-regex negative control fails; full release gate passes.
resolution: Measured operation CPU in the worker and retained an independent parent hang watchdog.
expected_result: Reject pathological parser work without penalizing scheduler delay.
actual_result: Seven linked parser operations and 466 release tests passed; the historical sectionVersionKey negative control failed its watchdog and source restoration was byte-verified.
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-07T23:18:58.598Z",codex-pm-coordinator,"Historical sectionVersionKey from f8c5138 parent was restored as a negative control: the real worker exceeded the 5000ms wall watchdog and failed. Exact generator.ts bytes were restored and verified. A separate normalizeReleaseHeadingKey-only historical probe remained below budget, so that probe is not evidence of regression rejection. The unchanged 250ms CPU budget and 5000ms hang watchdog are independently enforced."
  "2026-09-07T23:28:50.214Z",codex-pm-coordinator,"Final full release:check passed466 tests with zero failures/skips and100.00 lines/branches/functions in the existing declared source scope; statement metric remains separately unproven under pmc-ilrh. Linked7-operation parser test also passed after the complete gate. No production source bytes changed; negative-control restoration verified exact bytes."
files[2]{path,scope}:
  test/generator-redos-worker.ts,project
  test/generator-redos.test.ts,project
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node --test test/generator-redos.test.ts,project,90,codex-pm-coordinator,"2026-09-07T23:18:56.390Z",local_mutation,chore/certify-pm-cli-2026-9-7
close_reason: "Verified parser regression fix: all seven linked operations pass under the unchanged 250 ms CPU budget and independent 5 s hang watchdog; the full release gate passed 466 tests with no skips. Restoring the historical sectionVersionKey parser failed the watchdog, and the original source bytes were restored. Package-wide statement coverage and external review availability remain separately open in pmc-ilrh and pmc-fv5g."
